  "question": {
    "text": "In YDSE apparatus as shown in figure wavelength of light used in <math><mi>λ</mi><mo>.</mo></math> The screen is moved away from the source with a constant speed V. Initial distance between screen and plane of slits was <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></math>. Suppose P is the point where <math><msup><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msup></math> order maxima was lying at <math><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></math> then after how much time third-order maxima will lie at this point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></math> on that screen?<br />\r<br />\r<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/drhauunzkhsufgfpxcegjolvcwcjabizwstktikqgxqdvrlgrl.jpeg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 144px;\" />",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "qDMGO",
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>D</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "Rs0sL",
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>D</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>V</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "5GL7t",
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>D</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>V</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "0e8cd",
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>D</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "At <math><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> .....(i)<br /><br />After t times <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>v</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> ......(ii)<br /><br />Dividing (i) and (ii) we get<br /><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>v</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mn>5</mn><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>D</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>v</mi><mi>t</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mn>2</mn><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>v</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>D</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>v</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>",
